    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d127-a1">

                <pb facs="0215" n="949" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg949"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Governor McIntire to
                        Mr. Uhl.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >State of Colorado</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Executive
                                Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a statement by
                    the clerk of the district court of Huerfano County, giving the facts as he
                    ascertained them concerning the citizenship of certain Italians killed at
                    Walsenburg. All the information obtained inclines me to believe that the clerk’s
                    statement is correct.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert W. McIntire</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Governor.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
